ENSURE typed scalar result or explicit failure without a false successful value
parse one complete expression and validate shape/binder restrictions
infer its type; reject unresolved typing errors
apply only optimizations sound for the chosen contract
execute with the selected machine and budget
publish a scalar only after successful completion

